{"seq":2,"slug":"cascaded-shadows","title":"级联阴影","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-lighting-global-illumination/shadows/cascaded-shadows","wordCount":1229,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"级联阴影\">级联阴影</h1><p>一张 2048×2048 的阴影贴图要同时服务脚下三米的草叶和视野尽头两公里的山脊，注定两头不讨好：分给草叶的纹素太少，近处阴影锯齿粗大；分给远山的纹素又太奢侈，远处的阴影细节人眼根本看不清。级联阴影贴图（CSM, Cascaded Shadow Maps）的解法直白得近乎暴力——别用一张图，用几张，按距离分工，近处用高密度的图、远处用覆盖广的图。它是 2026 年所有开放世界平行光阴影的事实标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-按视锥距离切片\">核心概念：按视锥距离切片</h2><p>CSM 把相机视锥沿深度切成若干段（典型 3-4 段，称作级联），每一段用一张独立的 shadow map 覆盖。近处的级联覆盖小、纹素密，阴影清晰；远处的级联覆盖大、纹素疏，但因为远所以看不出糊。着色时根据像素到相机的距离，选对应级联的 shadow map 去采样。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[相机视锥] --&gt; B[按深度切成 3-4 段]&#10;  B --&gt; C0[级联0: 近&lt;br/&gt;覆盖小, 纹素密]&#10;  B --&gt; C1[级联1: 中]&#10;  B --&gt; C2[级联2: 远&lt;br/&gt;覆盖大, 纹素疏]&#10;  C0 --&gt; D[各自从光源渲一张 shadow map]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D&#10;  C2 --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[着色: 按像素深度选级联]&#10;  E --&gt; F[采样对应 shadow map&lt;br/&gt;含级联间过渡]\">flowchart TD\n  A[相机视锥] --&gt; B[按深度切成 3-4 段]\n  B --&gt; C0[级联0: 近&lt;br/&gt;覆盖小, 纹素密]\n  B --&gt; C1[级联1: 中]\n  B --&gt; C2[级联2: 远&lt;br/&gt;覆盖大, 纹素疏]\n  C0 --&gt; D[各自从光源渲一张 shadow map]\n  C1 --&gt; D\n  C2 --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[着色: 按像素深度选级联]\n  E --&gt; F[采样对应 shadow map&lt;br/&gt;含级联间过渡]</pre><p>每张级联本质还是上一节的 <a href=\"shadow-mapping\">阴影贴图</a>，所以痤疮、偏移、PCF 那一套毛病和补丁照单全收——只是现在要乘以级联数。CSM 没有发明新的阴影原理，它只是把有限的纹素预算按「人眼能分辨的角分辨率」重新分配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"切分策略-对数-均匀与实用混合\">切分策略：对数、均匀与实用混合</h2><p>视锥怎么切，直接决定纹素利用率。三种经典策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>切分点公式思路</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>均匀 (uniform)</td>\n<td>按距离线性分段</td>\n<td>近处浪费纹素、远处不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对数 (logarithmic)</td>\n<td>按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 指数分段</td>\n<td>理论最优，近处过密</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实用 (practical)</td>\n<td>对数与均匀加权混合</td>\n<td>工业界默认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对数切分源于一个观察：透视投影下，屏幕上单位像素对应的世界距离随深度指数增长，所以理论最优的切分点应满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>f</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>i</mi><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_i = \\lambda\\, n\\left(\\frac{f}{n}\\right)^{i/N} + (1-\\lambda)\\left(n + \\frac{i}{N}(f-n)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6779em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7279em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3365em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是近远平面，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是级联数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是对数与均匀的混合权重（常取 0.5 左右）。纯对数在近处会把级联挤得过密，纯均匀又远处不足，所以工业界用这个加权混合，这就是表里的「实用」策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"接缝-抖动与稳定化\">接缝、抖动与稳定化</h2><p>CSM 最磨人的不是切分而是过渡处的接缝。相邻级联分辨率不同，在边界两侧阴影宽度、走样程度突变，会出现可见的「断层」。标准解法是在级联交界处留一段重叠带，对两个级联的采样结果做线性混合，让过渡平滑。</p>\n<p>更隐蔽的问题是边缘游移（shadow edge swimming）：相机一移动，级联覆盖的世界区域随之平移，shadow map 纹素落在世界里的位置就变了，导致阴影边缘像水波一样抖动、闪烁。这是上一章 <a href=\"../foundations/why-gi-hard\">为何全局光照困难</a> 里讲的时间一致性问题在阴影上的具体化。稳定化的做法是把级联包围盒量化（snap）到 shadow map 纹素网格的整数倍——让覆盖区域只能整纹素跳动，而不是连续滑动，抖动就被钉死了。这个细节做不好，再清晰的单帧阴影在运动中也会露馅。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程取舍-级联数-分辨率与预算\">工程取舍：级联数、分辨率与预算</h2><p>CSM 的成本几乎与级联数成正比——每多一级，多一趟光源视角的几何渲染。所以级联数、每级分辨率、最远阴影距离三者构成一个三角预算。移动端常用 2 级、每级 1024；主机和 PC 常用 3-4 级、每级 2048。还有几个常用省钱手段：远级联可以隔帧更新（远处阴影变化慢，没必要每帧重渲）；用 shadow map 缓存，只在场景或光照变化时重渲静态部分；以及把 CSM 与屏幕空间的 <a href=\"contact-soft-shadows\">接触与软阴影</a> 配合——CSM 管中远景的大轮廓，接触阴影补近景物体落地处的细节。这套预算如何与整帧 GPU 时间协调，见 <a href=\"../practice/lighting-performance\">光照性能</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CSM 用多张按距离分工的 shadow map，解决「一张图覆盖远近」的纹素分配矛盾。</li>\n<li>切分策略在对数与均匀间加权（实用策略 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda\\approx0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>），平衡近密远疏。</li>\n<li>级联接缝靠重叠带混合，边缘游移靠把覆盖盒量化到纹素网格来稳定化。</li>\n<li>成本与级联数近似成正比；移动端 2 级、PC/主机 3-4 级是常见配置。</li>\n<li>远级联隔帧更新、静态缓存、与接触阴影配合，是主要省钱手段。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"shadow-mapping\">阴影贴图</a>：每张级联仍是一张普通 shadow map。</li>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"contact-soft-shadows\">接触与软阴影</a>：补 CSM 顾不到的近景落地细节。</li>\n<li>同库 <a href=\"../foundations/why-gi-hard\">为何全局光照困难</a>：边缘游移是时间一致性问题的具体化。</li>\n<li>跨库 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/practice/platform-optimization\">性能优化 · 平台优化</a>：不同平台的阴影预算取舍。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"级联阴影","id":"级联阴影"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：按视锥距离切片","id":"核心概念-按视锥距离切片"},{"level":2,"text":"切分策略：对数、均匀与实用混合","id":"切分策略-对数-均匀与实用混合"},{"level":2,"text":"接缝、抖动与稳定化","id":"接缝-抖动与稳定化"},{"level":2,"text":"工程取舍：级联数、分辨率与预算","id":"工程取舍-级联数-分辨率与预算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"阴影贴图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-lighting-global-illumination/shadows/shadow-mapping"},"next":{"title":"接触与软阴影","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-lighting-global-illumination/shadows/contact-soft-shadows"}}